{
"version": "1",
"text": "You are wearing a black ribbed turtleneck top with long sleeves that sit comfortably at your waist. This is paired with high-waisted, dark grey wide-leg trousers that fall loosely from the hip to create a soft, vertical line down your legs. A wide red belt adorned with feathers cinches the natural waist to draw the eye there and add a touch of playful elegance. Completing the look are sleek black mule shoes with a low heel for easy movement throughout the day, and a structured brown leather tote bag that offers practical storage in a classic shape.",
"how_to_wear": [
"As you start your morning in the office, wear the turtleneck top with the trousers as is; the high neckline adds polish without feeling too formal. If the room gets warmer later in the day, the loose fit of your trousers allows for easy breathability while maintaining a neat silhouette. The red belt acts as your only color accent, drawing attention to the waist and breaking up the dark tones so you look intentional rather than somber."
],
