"about_items": [
{
"n": "#37·30",
"text": "This is a black ribbed turtleneck sweater with long sleeves that hug the torso gently before falling into soft cuffs. Its high neck offers a clean, polished line perfect for an office setting while remaining comfortable enough for all-day wear."
}, {
"n": "#46·05",
"text": "These are high-waisted trousers in a dark graphite tone made of a soft, drapey fabric that falls into wide, relaxed legs. The slightly tapered ankle gives the pants structure without adding volume to your lower half, keeping the silhouette streamlined."
}, {
"n": "#285·10",
"text": "These are black leather mules with a flat sole and a rounded toe that slip on easily for a seamless start to your day. The low heel provides just enough elevation to feel elevated while remaining comfortable for walking between meetings or grabbing coffee."
}, {
"n": "#158·38",
"text": "This is a large brown leather tote bag with two sturdy handles and a relaxed, slouchy shape that expands as you pack it. The pebbled texture adds subtle interest while the neutral tone pairs effortlessly with your black base and red accent."
}, {
"n": "#104·19",
"text": "This is a wide red belt trimmed with soft feathers that sits at your natural waist to define your silhouette without feeling restrictive. The vibrant hue brings energy to the otherwise monochrome outfit while the feather detail adds a whimsical touch of femininity."
}
]
}
